    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 28, right: 60, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>03 / 18</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 28, left: 60, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>教学示例 · 数字为虚构演示</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>导入：一份被秒拒的简历</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, height: 470 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, height: '100%', background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', borderRadius: 12, padding: 28, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingBottom: 10 }}>求职者 A · 应聘 AI 产品经理</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>自我评价</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>性格开朗，吃苦耐劳，精通各种办公软件，学习能力强。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>技能区</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>熟练使用 Office 办公软件；了解 PS 与视频剪辑；沟通能力强；有责任心。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>项目经历</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>参与 XX 项目，负责部分工作，配合完成上线。负责运营公众号，撰写推文若干篇。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>接下来 2 分钟</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>对照屏幕上的这份简历，逐段扫描，把你觉得「让它被秒拒」的问题记下来。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>观察视角</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>自我评价 / 技能区 / 项目经历，三段里哪些是空话，哪些没有证据。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
